79:     storeIsEmpty
80:       ? "Nothing is stored long term. Say so plainly and word it differently than last time."
81:       : "You may name what is stored, briefly, and nothing beyond it.",
82:     "At most one topic from recent messages, as a short phrase rather than a list.",
83:   ];
84:   if (repeatRecall) {
